{"step_index":272,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:17:08Z","thinking":"**Constructing Renderer Logic**\n\nI'm now implementing the `js/character-renderer.js` file, focusing on managing the `characterState`. This involves defining the initial structure, which includes outfit details such as shirt and pants colors, using JavaScript syntax for clarity and organization. I've begun with the shirt and pants, detailing allowed states, like 'yellow', 'blue' and 'orange'.\n\n\n**Defining Character State Details**\n\nI've expanded the `characterState` to include shoes, pose, expression, seatbelt, and holding values, alongside shirt and pants. The public API methods have been outlined, encompassing setters, a reset function, and render/update methods. I'm also mapping assets, linking attributes like shirt and pants to their SVG layers and defining how things like the seatbelt and pose will affect the look. I have begun work on the asset mapping table.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * character-renderer.js - Character State Renderer for Bé Bin\n * Quản lý trạng thái trang phục, tư thế (pose) và đai an toàn xuyên suốt 8 Level\n * KHÔNG hard-code asset trong gameplay - Gameplay chỉ thay đổi state qua API.\n */\n\nclass CharacterRenderer {\n    constructor() {\n        // State mặc định của Bé Bin\n        this.characterState = {\n            outfit: {\n                shirt: 'yellow',       // 'yellow' | 'blue'\n                pants: 'orange',       // 'orange' | 'blue'\n                shoes: 'blue_velcro'   // 'blue_velcro' | 'white_laces'\n            },\n            pose: 'standing',          // 'standing' | 'happy' | 'pointing' | 'seated' | 'drinking_water' | 'looking_window' | 'whispering' | 'sitting_neat' | 'holding_badge'\n            expression: 'normal',      // 'normal' | 'happy' | 'whispering'\n            seatbelt: 'none',          // 'none' | 'open' | 'fastened'\n            holding: null              // null | 'water' | 'ticket' | 'badge'\n        };\n\n        // Bảng ánh xạ Asset đường dẫn chuẩn\n        this.assetManifest = {\n            baseBody: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/bin_base.svg',\n            shirts: {\n                yellow: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_yellow.svg',\n                blue: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_blue.svg'\n            },\n            pants: {\n                orange: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_orange.svg',\n                blue: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_blue.svg'\n            },\n            shoes: {\n                blue_velcro: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_blue_velcro.svg',\n                white_laces: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_white_laces.svg'\n            },\n            seatbelts: {\n                open: 'assets/characters/bin/layers/seatbelt_open.svg',\n                fastened: 'assets/characters/bin/layers/seatbelt_fastened.svg'\n            },\n            poses: {\n                standing: null, // Dùng hệ layer dress\n                seated: 'assets/characters/bin/poses/seated_base.svg',\n                drinking_water: 'assets/characters/bin/poses/seated_drinking.svg',\n                looking_window: 'assets/characters/bin/poses/looking_window.svg',\n                whispering: 'assets/characters/bin/poses/whispering.svg',\n                sitting_neat: 'assets/characters/bin/poses/sitting_neat.svg',\n                holding_badge: 'assets/characters/bin/poses/holding_badge.svg'\n            },\n            // Màu trang phục đồng bộ vào CSS Variables để các Pose SVG tự động kế thừa\n            palette: {\n                shirt: {\n                    yellow: '#FDD835',\n                    blue: '#0288D1'\n                },\n                pants: {\n                    orange: '#FFA726',\n                    blue: '#1E88E5'\n                },\n                shoes: {\n                    blue_velcro: '#1976D2',\n                    white_laces: '#FFFFFF'\n                }\n            }\n        };\n\n        this.init();\n    }\n\n    init() {\n        this.syncThemeVariables();\n    }\n\n    // --- CẬP NHẬT CSS VARIABLES ĐỂ TẤT CẢ POSE KẾ THỪA MÀU TRANG PHỤC ĐÃ CHỌN ---\n    syncThemeVariables() {\n        const root = document.documentElement;\n        const shirtHex = this.assetManifest.palette.shirt[this.characterState.outfit.shirt] || '#FDD835';\n        const pantsHex = this.assetManifest.palette.pants[this.characterState.outfit.pants] || '#FFA726';\n        const shoesHex = this.assetManifest.palette.shoes[this.characterState.outfit.shoes] || '#1976D2';\n\n        root.style.setProperty('--bin-shirt-color', shirtHex);\n        root.style.setProperty('--bin-pants-color', pantsHex);\n        root.style.setProperty('--bin-shoes-color', shoesHex);\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // PUBLIC STATE API (GỌI TỪ GAMEPLAY CONTROLLER)\n    // ==========================================================================\n\n    setShirt(value) {\n        if (!this.assetManifest.shirts[value]) return;\n        this.characterState.outfit.shirt = value;\n        this.syncThemeVariables();\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setPants(value) {\n        if (!this.assetManifest.pants[value]) return;\n        this.characterState.outfit.pants = value;\n        this.syncThemeVariables();\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setShoes(value) {\n        if (!this.assetManifest.shoes[value]) return;\n        this.characterState.outfit.shoes = value;\n        this.syncThemeVariables();\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setOutfit(outfitObj) {\n        if (!outfitObj) return;\n        if (outfitObj.shirt && this.assetManifest.shirts[outfitObj.shirt]) {\n            this.characterState.outfit.shirt = outfitObj.shirt;\n        }\n        if (outfitObj.pants && this.assetManifest.pants[outfitObj.pants]) {\n            this.characterState.outfit.pants = outfitObj.pants;\n        }\n        if (outfitObj.shoes && this.assetManifest.shoes[outfitObj.shoes]) {\n            this.characterState.outfit.shoes = outfitObj.shoes;\n        }\n        this.syncThemeVariables();\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setPose(poseName) {\n        this.characterState.pose = poseName;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setExpression(expressionName) {\n        this.characterState.expression = expressionName;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setSeatbelt(seatbeltState) {\n        this.characterState.seatbelt = seatbeltState; // 'none' | 'open' | 'fastened'\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setHolding(item) {\n        this.characterState.holding = item;\n        if (item === 'water') {\n            this.setPose('drinking_water');\n        } else if (item === 'badge') {\n            this.setPose('holding_badge');\n        } else {\n            this.updateAll();\n        }\n    }\n\n    reset() {\n        this.characterState = {\n            outfit: {\n                shirt: 'yellow',\n                pants: 'orange',\n                shoes: 'blue_velcro'\n            },\n            pose: 'standing',\n            expression: 'normal',\n            seatbelt: 'none',\n            holding: null\n        };\n        this.syncThemeVariables();\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // RENDER ENGINE: TẠO VÀ CẬP NHẬT CÁC LAYER HÌNH ẢNH\n    // ==========================================================================\n\n    renderTo(containerEl, customPose = null, customSeatbelt = null) {\n        if (!containerEl) return;\n\n        const effectivePose = customPose || this.characterState.pose;\n        const effectiveSeatbelt = customSeatbelt !== null ? customSeatbelt : this.characterState.seatbelt;\n        const isStandingLayered = effectivePose === 'standing' || effectivePose === 'happy';\n\n        containerEl.innerHTML = '';\n        containerEl.classList.add('bin-character-frame');\n\n        if (isStandingLayered) {\n            // HỆ LAYER LEVEL 1 & STANDING: Base Body + Shoes + Pants + Shirt + Accessories\n            const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n            wrapper.className = 'bin-layered-stack';\n\n            // 1. Layer Base Body\n            const baseImg = document.createElement('img');\n            baseImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-base';\n            baseImg.src = this.assetManifest.baseBody;\n            baseImg.alt = 'Bé Bin Base Body';\n            wrapper.appendChild(baseImg);\n\n            // 2. Layer Giày (Shoes)\n            if (this.characterState.outfit.shoes && this.assetManifest.shoes[this.characterState.outfit.shoes]) {\n                const shoesImg = document.createElement('img');\n                shoesImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-shoes pop-in-soft';\n                shoesImg.src = this.assetManifest.shoes[this.characterState.outfit.shoes];\n                shoesImg.alt = 'Giày của Bin';\n                wrapper.appendChild(shoesImg);\n            }\n\n            // 3. Layer Quần (Pants)\n            if (this.characterState.outfit.pants && this.assetManifest.pants[this.characterState.outfit.pants]) {\n                const pantsImg = document.createElement('img');\n                pantsImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-pants pop-in-soft';\n                pantsImg.src = this.assetManifest.pants[this.characterState.outfit.pants];\n                pantsImg.alt = 'Quần của Bin';\n                wrapper.appendChild(pantsImg);\n            }\n\n            // 4. Layer Áo (Shirt)\n            if (this.characterState.outfit.shirt && this.assetManifest.shirts[this.characterState.outfit.shirt]) {\n                const shirtImg = document.createElement('img');\n                shirtImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-shirt pop-in-soft';\n                shirtImg.src = this.assetManifest.shirts[this.characterState.outfit.shirt];\n                shirtImg.alt = 'Áo của Bin';\n                wrapper.appendChild(shirtImg);\n            }\n\n            // 5. Layer Dây An Toàn (Nếu có)\n            if (effectiveSeatbelt && this.assetManifest.seatbelts[effectiveSeatbelt]) {\n                const beltImg = document.createElement('img');\n                beltImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-seatbelt pop-in-soft';\n                beltImg.src = this.assetManifest.seatbelts[effectiveSeatbelt];\n                beltImg.alt = 'Dây an toàn';\n                wrapper.appendChild(beltImg);\n            }\n\n            containerEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n        } else {\n            // POSE ĐẶC BIỆT (Seated, Drinking, Looking Window, Whispering, Sitting Neat, Holding Badge)\n            const poseSrc = this.assetManifest.poses[effectivePose] || this.assetManifest.poses.seated;\n            const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n            wrapper.className = 'bin-layered-stack';\n\n            const poseImg = document.createElement('img');\n            poseImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-pose pop-in-soft';\n            poseImg.src = poseSrc;\n            poseImg.alt = `Bé Bin ${effectivePose}`;\n            wrapper.appendChild(poseImg);\n\n            // Thêm layer đai an toàn nếu pose seated và có yêu cầu\n            if (effectiveSeatbelt && this.assetManifest.seatbelts[effectiveSeatbelt]) {\n                const beltImg = document.createElement('img');\n                beltImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-seatbelt pop-in-soft';\n                beltImg.src = this.assetManifest.seatbelts[effectiveSeatbelt];\n                beltImg.alt = 'Dây an toàn';\n                wrapper.appendChild(beltImg);\n            }\n\n            containerEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n        }\n    }\n\n    // Cập nhật tất cả các mount point chứa nhân vật trên các màn chơi\n    updateAll() {\n        // 1. Mount point Level 1 Sân khấu chính\n        const lvl1Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl1');\n        if (lvl1Mount) this.renderTo(lvl1Mount, 'standing', 'none');\n\n        // 2. Mount point Level 3 Cổng An Ninh\n        const lvl3Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl3');\n        if (lvl3Mount) this.renderTo(lvl3Mount, 'standing', 'none');\n\n        // 3. Mount point Level 5 Ghế Ngồi Khoang Bay (Đai an toàn & Uống nước)\n        const lvl5Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl5');\n        if (lvl5Mount) {\n            const beltState = this.characterState.seatbelt || 'open';\n            this.renderTo(lvl5Mount, this.characterState.pose === 'drinking_water' ? 'drinking_water' : 'seated', beltState);\n        }\n\n        // 4. Mount point Level 6 Nhìn Cửa Sổ\n        const lvl6Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl6');\n        if (lvl6Mount) this.renderTo(lvl6Mount, 'looking_window', 'fastened');\n\n        // 5. Mount point Level 7 Lịch Sự\n        const lvl7Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl7');\n        if (lvl7Mount) {\n            const pose7 = this.characterState.pose === 'whispering' ? 'whispering' : (this.characterState.pose === 'sitting_neat' ? 'sitting_neat' : 'seated');\n            this.renderTo(lvl7Mount, pose7, 'fastened');\n        }\n\n        // 6. Mount point Level 8 Nhận Thưởng\n        const lvl8Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl8');\n        if (lvl8Mount) {\n            const pose8 = this.characterState.pose === 'holding_badge' ? 'holding_badge' : 'standing';\n            this.renderTo(lvl8Mount, pose8, this.characterState.seatbelt === 'fastened' ? 'fastened' : 'open');\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Khởi tạo instance toàn cục\nwindow.binRenderer = new CharacterRenderer();\n","Description":"Tạo Character State Renderer Engine trong js/character-renderer.js","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\character-renderer.js","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Create character-renderer.js"}}]}
