{"step_index":276,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T06:17:41Z","thinking":"**Updating HTML Index**\n\nI've just added the script tag for `character-renderer.js`, ensuring it loads before `app.js`. Then, I swapped out those old, hardcoded image tags. Now, I'm using mount points instead, such as `<div id=\"bin-character-mount-lvl1\">`, to provide dynamic character rendering. This allows me to control character data directly from JavaScript, instead of directly editing html elements.\n\n\n**Expanding Mount Points**\n\nI've been creating mount points for levels 3, 5, 6, 7, and 8. Level 6 will showcase Bin looking out the window, and these are now placed next to the cloud frame. Also, I’m working on equipping the wardrobe in Level 1 with data attributes for different outfits: yellow/blue shirts, orange/blue shorts, and blue Velcro or white laced shoes. It will allow for dynamic customization.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=3.0, user-scalable=yes, viewport-fit=cover\">\n    <title>Cùng Bé Bin Đi Máy Bay (Parent-Co-Play Interactive Book)</title>\n    <!-- Offline font fallback stack & Google Font -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@700;800;900&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"css/style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n    <div id=\"app-root\">\n        <!-- Canvas Pháo hoa, Sao lấp lánh & Trái tim -->\n        <canvas id=\"effects-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- TOP BAR: 8 LEVEL DOTS & CỔNG BA MẸ -->\n        <header class=\"top-nav\">\n            <nav class=\"stage-indicators\" aria-label=\"Tiến trình chuyến bay\">\n                <button class=\"stage-dot active\" data-screen=\"1\" aria-label=\"Level 1: Mặc đồ\">👕</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"2\" aria-label=\"Level 2: Xếp vali\">🧳</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"3\" aria-label=\"Level 3: Kiểm tra an ninh\">🎫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"4\" aria-label=\"Level 4: Tìm Cổng Bay\">🚪</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"5\" aria-label=\"Level 5: Hiệp sĩ đai\">🦸</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"6\" aria-label=\"Level 6: Ngắm mây\">☁️</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"7\" aria-label=\"Level 7: Lịch sự\">🤫</button>\n                <button class=\"stage-dot locked\" data-screen=\"8\" aria-label=\"Level 8: Nhận vali & Thưởng\">🏆</button>\n            </nav>\n\n            <!-- Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây) -->\n            <button id=\"btn-parent-gate\" class=\"tycoon-btn parent-gate-btn\" aria-label=\"Cổng Ba Mẹ (Giữ 3 giây)\">\n                <svg class=\"parent-hold-ring\" viewBox=\"0 0 60 60\">\n                    <circle id=\"parent-ring-circle\" cx=\"30\" cy=\"30\" r=\"26\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n                ⚙️ <span>Ba Mẹ</span>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- BIỂN BÁO LỜI THOẠI BA MẸ ĐỌC CHO BÉ -->\n        <div class=\"parent-prompt-container\">\n            <div class=\"parent-prompt-signboard\">\n                <div id=\"parent-prompt-avatar\" class=\"prompt-avatar-sprite speaker-mom\"></div>\n                <span id=\"parent-prompt-text\" class=\"prompt-speech-text\">“Bin sắp đi máy bay rồi. Con chọn bộ đồ nào giúp Bin dễ vận động nhé!”</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- VIEWPORT 8 MÀN CHƠI CHÍNH -->\n        <main class=\"screens-viewport\">\n\n            <!-- =====================================